The '''Statue of Endless Fortune''' is a piece of [[Furniture]] that can be purchased for {{Price|1000000}} from a shady male NPC in the [[Casino]]. It produces one gift or item each day. If an item is not collected, it will be replaced by a new item the next day. [[The Player|The player]] can purchase as many of these statues as desired.

The statue is one of the most expensive items in the game but also one of the easiest ways to obtain [[Iridium Bar]]s.

==Normal Days==
On days when no [[Villagers|villager]] has a birthday, the statue has an equal chance of producing one of four items: {{Name|Diamond|class=inline}}, {{Name|Iridium Bar|class=inline}}, {{Name|Omni Geode|class=inline}}, or {{Name|Gold Bar|class=inline}}.

==Birthdays==
On a villager's birthday, the statue will produce a specific one of their "loved" items. The quality of the item is always normal (lowest quality). The player has to have met the villager for the statue to produce the respective item. If not, the statue will produce an item like on a normal day. 

